      "message": "Jiyong, in this change, I added support \"apex\" variants that are spawned from \"sdk\" variants.\nFor example, when a module sets sdk_version and sdk_variant_only, apex will bundle the apex variant spawned from sdk variant, which have set sdk_version.  I think we could accept that cc.sdk_version \u003c\u003d apex.min_sdk_version for native modules.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2861,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2863,
        "endChar": 2
      },
      "revId": "f9b9204a5af70b1e6fe224097da7a60bc2dae726",
