      "writtenOn": "2020-04-23T09:48:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since this is a fallback behavior, we can have \u0027sdk_version:30\u0027 \u0026\u0026 \u0027min_sdk_version:29\u0027 at the same time, right? If so, I feel fine with this change.\n\nAlso, if I am okay with this, I wonder why we even have the \u0027c.UseSdk()\u0027 condition.",
      "parentUuid": "a84104fd_196318c0",
      "range": {
