      "message": "\u003e I\u0027ll remove the fallback behavior.\n\nAck. But FTR, I am fine with the fallback behavior.\n\n\u003e because sdkMutator clears Sdk_version property for non-sdk variants.\n\nI see. I thought c.SdkVersion() would return \"\" in that case, but it\u0027s not; it returns what\u0027s written in sdk_version property.",
